 triage:issue "Public schema trait methods reach prohibited expect calls: Envelope<T>::json_schema at envelope.rs244 and the ErrorKind/OpError canonical_schema expansions at error.rs436/441. ADR0006 point3 bans reachable expect, including fixed-schema conversion assertions; ADR0017 grants only the named Noop invariant exception." ;
 triage:action "Construct the owned Schemars/OpenAPI schemas with infallible native map/builders while preserving the actual wire shape. Remove all three public schema conversion expects; do not add a panic-policy waiver." ;
 triage:disposition "Infallible native Schemars/Utoipa schemas in sc-command envelope/error and sc-cron-commands contract; six schema-enabled contract regressions, including exact arbitrary-JSON wire checks." ;
