 triage:action "Freeze and provide reason-specific, value-free classification/recovery for the implemented context and legacy-safe refusal paths. Cancellation/expiry should direct callers to the stopped/expired scope and owned completion/reconciliation responsibilities; an unsupported provider should direct callers to the supported cooperative override. Do not recommend changing healthy database files, or imply uncertain mutations may be replayed." ;
